  m_Name: ArcadeGameReefbuild
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  Mode: 112
  IsMultiplayer: 1
  DisplayName: Reefbuild
  Description: 'Wrasse and Grouper only - build a reef in open water. The Wrasse loops its tail round
    Mass motes and a cluster of your prisms grows where the loop closed; the more motes in
    one loop, the far bigger the cluster. Rival kites pop and blast what you build, and
    yours can do the same to theirs. Gather Mass crystals and more Mass motes come to the
    board. Higher intensities thin the crystals. When the clock runs out, the team with the
    most reef standing wins.'
